Concrete `krun` executions now terminate with the expected results (`3`, `-1`, `4`, and `-1` across representative cases). The universal reachability claim also closes with `#Top`; I’m tightening its precondition to state that the symbolic array view is in bounds, then I’ll rerun the proof from a clean scripted workflow.
